CowSwapModuleFactory_Fork
├── when the factory is deployed against the real GPv2Settlement
│   ├── it should deploy successfully
│   ├── it should reject an EOA settlement address
│   └── when create is called by the factory owner
│       ├── it should wire the module to the real settlement domain separator
│       ├── it should wire the module to the real vault relayer
│       ├── it should register the module in the factory
│       ├── it should deploy a module for a PaymentRails the factory owner does not own
│       └── when the module is configured on a PaymentRails
│           └── it should execute a real USDC order end-to-end
├── when create is called by a non-owner against a real PaymentRails
│   ├── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
│   └── it should leave the PaymentRails lookup empty
└── when createDeterministic is called on the fork
    └── it should deploy to the predicted address
